payload@ 132 01 00 01 00
payload@ 136 03 00 00 00
payload@ 144 01 00 00 00
payload@ 152 10 00 00 00
payload@ 168 01 00 00 00
payload@ 172 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 192 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 196 01 00 01 00
payload@ 200 04 00 00 00
payload@ 208 01 00 00 00
payload@ 216 10 00 00 00
payload@ 232 01 00 00 00
payload@ 236 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 256 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 260 01 00 01 00
payload@ 264 05 00 00 00
payload@ 272 01 00 00 00
payload@ 280 10 00 00 00
payload@ 296 01 00 00 00
payload@ 300 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 320 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 324 01 00 01 00
payload@ 328 06 00 00 00
payload@ 336 01 00 00 00
payload@ 344 10 00 00 00
payload@ 360 01 00 00 00
payload@ 364 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 384 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 388 01 00 01 00
payload@ 392 07 00 00 00
payload@ 400 01 00 00 00
payload@ 408 10 00 00 00
payload@ 424 01 00 00 00
payload@ 428 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 448 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 452 01 00 01 00
payload@ 456 08 00 00 00
payload@ 464 01 00 00 00
payload@ 472 10 00 00 00
payload@ 488 01 00 00 00
payload@ 492 90 D0 03 00

cmd F2 47 4B 05 00 00 00 00
data out 4
expect@ 0 00 00 00 00
note first eight: accepted

cmd F4 47 4B 00 00 00 02 00
data in 512
payload@ 0   47 4B 44 31
payload@ 4   01 00 01 00
payload@ 8   09 00 00 00
payload@ 16  01 00 00 00
payload@ 24  10 00 00 00
payload@ 40  01 00 00 00
payload@ 44  90 D0 03 00
payload@ 64  47 4B 44 31
payload@ 68  01 00 01 00
payload@ 72  0A 00 00 00
payload@ 80  01 00 00 00
payload@ 88  10 00 00 00
payload@ 104 01 00 00 00
payload@ 108 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 128 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 132 01 00 01 00
payload@ 136 0B 00 00 00
payload@ 144 01 00 00 00
payload@ 152 10 00 00 00
payload@ 168 01 00 00 00
payload@ 172 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 192 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 196 01 00 01 00
payload@ 200 0C 00 00 00
payload@ 208 01 00 00 00
payload@ 216 10 00 00 00
payload@ 232 01 00 00 00
payload@ 236 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 256 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 260 01 00 01 00
payload@ 264 0D 00 00 00
payload@ 272 01 00 00 00
payload@ 280 10 00 00 00
payload@ 296 01 00 00 00
payload@ 300 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 320 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 324 01 00 01 00
payload@ 328 0E 00 00 00
payload@ 336 01 00 00 00
payload@ 344 10 00 00 00
payload@ 360 01 00 00 00
payload@ 364 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 384 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 388 01 00 01 00
payload@ 392 0F 00 00 00
payload@ 400 01 00 00 00
payload@ 408 10 00 00 00
payload@ 424 01 00 00 00
payload@ 428 90 D0 03 00
payload@ 448 47 4B 44 31
payload@ 452 01 00 01 00
payload@ 456 10 00 00 00
payload@ 464 01 00 00 00
payload@ 472 10 00 00 00
payload@ 488 01 00 00 00
payload@ 492 90 D0 03 00

cmd F2 47 4B 05 00 00 00 00
data out 4
expect@ 0 00 00 00 00
note second eight: still accepted, the queue is now exactly full

cmd F2 47 4B FE 00 00 00 00
data out 4
expect@ 0 10 00 00 00
note sixteen queued

cmd F4 47 4B 00 00 00 00 40
data in 512
payload@ 0  47 4B 44 31
payload@ 4  01 00 01 00
payload@ 8  11 00 00 00
payload@ 16 01 00 00 00
payload@ 24 10 00 00 00
payload@ 40 01 00 00 00
payload@ 44 90 D0 03 00

cmd F2 47 4B 05 00 00 00 00
data out 4
expect@ 0 07 00 00 00
note QueueFull = 7. The seventeenth job ran but its completion had nowhere to
note go, and the client is told so. Silently dropping it would look exactly like
note a job that never executed, which is the most expensive kind of failure to
note diagnose on hardware.

cmd F2 47 4B FE 00 00 00 00
data out 4
expect@ 0 10 00 00 00
note still sixteen; nothing was overwritten

cmd F5 47 4B 01 02 00 00 00
data out 512
expect@ 0  47 4B 43 31
expect@ 8  01 00 00 00
expect@ 448 47 4B 43 31
expect@ 456 08 00 00 00
note draining returns the first eight in order, oldest first
end
